# Doppler (pavilion)

**Doppler project `pavilion` / config `dev`:** `VERCEL_TOKEN`, `VERCEL_ORG_ID` for **robert-4220** Vercel CLI.

```bash
./scripts/vercel-robert4220.sh … --scope robert-4220s-projects
# or
./scripts/doppler_run.sh env -u VERCEL_ORG_ID npx vercel … --scope robert-4220s-projects
```

Local `.env`: `DOPPLER_TOKEN` only (service token from Doppler → pavilion → dev).

**Ship product:** `node scripts/ship-pavilion.mjs --target commons-pto-demo`  
**Promote to SHMS (dry-run):** `node scripts/promote-to-shms.mjs` — does not update www until SHMS ship.

**Not here:** Stone Hill Wix keys, treasurer account, `shmspto/prd`. Those live in **`~/shmspto`** + Doppler **`shmspto`**.

**CWN** uses Doppler **`auraflux/prd`**.  
`~/hskrg-work` uses the same **pavilion/dev** Doppler token.
